# Variable names only. No values belong in git (plan A6 / NSE-001).
# Copy to .env and fill the blanks locally. Never commit .env.
# Commented names keep the code default. An empty value on a number, bool,
# or mode would override that default and break startup, so those stay commented.
# Real orders still need mode live and live_orders true. Both stay unset here.

# Angel One SmartAPI. Login stays manual (scripts/login_check.py), never CI.
